~ Sign
if State.sign_smeared == "true"
	The sign is splattered in ink. 
	=> END
else:
	You read the sign
	Sign: There was a hero who grew up in a small village, far out in the skies... at a very young age she was made to grow up as a result of losing too many people dear to her. Her days of childhood were over the moment she began to wish for others to continue onwards in peace.
	Sign: Over the years, she began to train harder and harder to maintain the youth and in the end, became heralded as the champion of her people...
	- Okay... (Continue)
		Sign: But ultimately... she found herself the most alone after bringing peace to her people. Despite her being immortalized in stone she was never able to find solace and understanding in anyone. To her, she was just a stranger who was gazed upon her people as a god.
	- Ugh, Boring
		You wander off mentally and stop reading. 
		=> END
	- Smear the sign in ink
		set State.sign_smeared = "true"
		Like the absolute menace you are, you smear the text of your story in ink that will last for generations. 
		=> END
	Sign: Some wonder where she is today... the last known sighting was over ____ years ago in the ____ continent.
	=> END

# Dialogue if you choose to walk towards fake exit
~ No_Return
There's no point turning back now. 
=> END


# Dialogue for cat character
~ Kitty
You see a familiar Kat in front of you.
- Pet it
	Cat: Purr :3
	=> END
- Ignore it
	Cat: D: 
	=> END
- Pray
	Cat: So you do remember. Very well, it's been a long time old friend. You must go forth and rediscover what happened to our home, find the next path onwards.  
	set State.hidden = "reveal"
	do Hidden_Manager.amogus()
	=> END
~ teleport
You sense an influx of energy...
do LevelSwap.next_level()
=> END
~ amogus
Amogus: AMOGUS.
THE END?
=> END